<h3 class=3D"mume-header" id=3D"piecewise-approximation">Piecewise Approxim=
ation</h3>

<ul>
<li>Piecewise Polynomial Approximation
<ul>
<li>Break function into multiple intervals</li>
<li>Create Polynomial Approximation for each interval (e.g. Taylor series e=
xpansion around middle of interval)</li>
<li>Store polynomial approximation for each interval in a lookup table (LUT=
)</li>
<li>During run:
<ul>
<li>decide interval to use,</li>
<li>use LUT to recall parameters for that interval</li>
<li>compute approximation</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
